; =============================================================================
; IMPL-IMAGO-SELFMOD — Implementation Plan for SPEC-012
; =============================================================================
; Decomposes SPEC-012 (agent self-modification port) into decision, scaffold,
; component, integration, theory, test, and review tasks. The spec is in
; status `draft` and carries four open questions (OQ-001..OQ-004) that the
; spec itself flags as gating: "human decision before the IMPL plan
; converges". The spec also mandates an adversarial review of CON-002 and
; CON-003 in a fresh context BEFORE any IMPL plan begins. Both gates are
; modelled as tasks here so readiness rules block component work until
; those facts are asserted.
;
; Source spec : specs/SPEC-012-self-modification-port.md
; Builds on   : SPEC-011 implementation (already complete in src/)
;
; Agent roles:
;   - decisions : human or human-supervised resolutions of OQ-001..OQ-004
;                 and the spec's required adversarial review
;   - impl      : the harness developer building the port
;   - reviewer  : verification before merge against the safety threat models

(meta plan
  (id "IMPL-IMAGO-SELFMOD")
  (title "anuna-imago — agent self-modification port (SPEC-012)")
  (version "0.1.0")
  (status "draft")
  (created "2026-04-28")
  (spec "specs/SPEC-012-self-modification-port.md")
  (description "Build the harness-eval port: opt-in tool registered by examples/self-modifying.lisp, three-layer safety stack (pre-filter, reasoner, handler), receipt-log audit, queryable origin index, per-call rollback register, starter theory file, and recursion-safety test corpus. Gated on resolution of OQ-001..OQ-004 and on a fresh-context adversarial review of CON-002 and CON-003."))

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; AGENTS
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

(given agent-decisions-available)
(given agent-impl-available)
(given agent-reviewer-available)

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; TASKS — decision gates (the spec's "before IMPL plan begins" checkpoints)
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

(given task-d00-adversarial-review)
(given task-d01-timeout-mechanism)
(given task-d02-package-isolation)
(given task-d03-result-serialisation)
(given task-d04-non-method-rollback)

(given no-deps-d00-adversarial-review)
(given no-deps-d01-timeout-mechanism)
(given no-deps-d02-package-isolation)
(given no-deps-d03-result-serialisation)
(given no-deps-d04-non-method-rollback)

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; TASKS — implementation
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

(given task-t01-scaffold)
(given task-t02-prefilter)
(given task-t03-lift)
(given task-t04-receipt)
(given task-t05-origin-index)
(given task-t06-rollback)
(given task-t07-handler)
(given task-t08-theory-floor)
